  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/master/icon.png\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>实体音效特性</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/esf-entity-sound-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fesf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h1>关于</h1><p>ESF 是一个允许基于ETF/OptiFine .properties格式实现实体音效多样化的模组。</p><p>ESF 还通过音效属性和音效动画功能为ETF和EMF增添了额外的音效相关功能。</p><h1>使用说明</h1><ul>\n<li>关于如何实现现有播放音效多样化的说明和示例，请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/VARIATION.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a></li>\n<li>关于如何使用为ETF和EMF新增的音效相关功能的说明，请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/UTILITY.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h1>更新日志</h1><p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/CHANGELOG.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查看更新日志。</p><hr><h1>需要帮助或有疑问？</h1><p>您可以通过我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord